{"sections":[{"slug":"λ-演算","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"λ-演算"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“λ-<span lang=\"zh\">演算</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“λ-演算”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p>#<span lang=\"zh\">计算机科学</span></p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">计算与约化</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">计算</span> $\\lambda$-<span lang=\"zh\">表达式的主要过程是</span> $\\beta$-<span lang=\"zh\">约化</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">例如</span>\n$$\r\n(\\lambda x.x+1)3=3+1.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">还有另外一些规则</span>: $\\alpha$-<span lang=\"zh\">约化是说</span> $(\\lambda x.fx)=(\\lambda y.fy)$, $\\eta$-<span lang=\"zh\">约化是说</span> $(\\lambda x.fx)=f$.</p>\n"}}}]}